# Force these as binary regardless of core.autocrlf, on every machine that
# clones/checks out this repo (including GitHub Actions' runner, which is
# what actually builds and deploys this site) — git's own binary-detection
# heuristic is usually right, but "usually" isn't good enough for a resume
# PDF or certificate images that must render byte-for-byte correctly.
*.pdf binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
